  "content": "[Intro]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dmaj7/F#]The [Gmaj7/B]radio's playing so-\n[Bsus2]ngs But there's loves we never get\n[Dmaj7/F#]Besides [Gmaj7/B]this one\n[Bsus2]Then we'd have to admit\n[Dmaj7/F#]it Let's [Gmaj7/B]keep it boxed up\n[Bsus2]A fiction we don't know we're li-\n[Dmaj7/F#]ving [Gmaj7/B]Pretending we have time\n[Bsus2]To take until we get\n\n[Chorus]\n[Em7]it It doesn't matter\n[Bmadd11]If we let it go\n[Em7]Right or wrong\n[Bmadd11]Right or wrong\n[Em7]It doesn't matter\n[Bmadd11]If we let it go\n\n[Bridge]\n[G6]Never [Asus2]turn this [A/C#]love [Em7]off\n[G6][Asus2][A/C#]Turn this [Em7]love off\n[D]  [Dadd11]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dmaj7/F#][Gmaj7/B]Saw your eyes straight on\n[Bsus2]Did I hold them for too long?\n[Dmaj7/F#][Gmaj7/B]Maybe no one saw\n[Bsus2]\n[Dmaj7/F#]Bringing [Gmaj7/B]this all up again\n[Bsus2]We used to talk about\n[Dmaj7/F#]it In [Gmaj7/B]empty party rooms\n[Dsus2]How wrong we always were\n[D]There's nothing to be done\n\n[Chorus]\n[Em7]It doesn't matter\n[Bmadd11]If we let it go\n[Em7]Right or wrong\n[Bmadd11]Right or wrong\n[Em7]It doesn't matter\n[Bmadd11]If we let it go\n\n[Bridge]\n[G6]Never [Asus2]turn this [A/C#]love [Em7]off\n[G6][Asus2]Turn this [A/C#]love [Em7]off\n\n[Break]\n[Em7]\n[D6add11]\n[Em7]\n[D6add11]\n[F#m]\n[G]\n[A]\n[Bm7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Em7]It doesn't matter\n[Bmadd11]If we let it go\n[Em7]Right or wrong\n[Bmadd11]Right or wrong\n[Em7]It doesn't matter\n[Bmadd11]If we let it go\n\n[Bridge]\n[G6]Never [Asus2]turn this [A/C#]love [Em7]off\n[G6][Asus2]Turn this [A/C#]love [Em7]off\n[D]\n\n[Outro]\n[A]\n[Bm7]\n[D]\n[Em7]\n[A]\n[Bm7]\n[D]\n[Em7]\n[A]\n[Bm7]\n[E5]",
